### Créer un brouillon autonome
POST {{GRAPH_BASE_URL}}/users/{{USER_ID_OR_UPN}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{GRAPH_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "{{SUBJECT}}",
  "body": {
    "contentType": "HTML",
    "content": "{{DRAFT_HTML}}"
  },
  "toRecipients": [
    {
      "emailAddress": {
        "address": "{{TO_EMAIL}}",
        "name": "{{TO_NAME}}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
